Q: how to display an error message if email and password is not valid in firebase flutter? A: <p>This method works.</p>
<pre><code>catch (e) {
    String errorMessage = e.toString();
    Get.snackbar(
      'Sign-up Failed',
      errorMessage.substring(errorMessage.indexOf(']') + 1),
      snackPosition: SnackPosition.BOTTOM,
    );
</code></pre>

Q: Bootstrap 4 responsive image with set height A: <p>Usually, when using Bootstrap you should use div with the class of container or container-fluid and after that div with the class of row. This worked for me </p>

<pre><code>&lt;div class="container"&gt;
 &lt;div class="row"&gt;
  &lt;div class="col-md-6"&gt;
   &lt;div class="card"&gt;
   &lt;img class="card-img-top" src="https://placeimg.com/640/480/animals" 
    alt="Card image cap" height="200"&gt;
   &lt;div class="card-body text-center"&gt;
    &lt;p class="card-text"&gt;Text goes here&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p class="card-subtitle"&gt;More text goes here&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;/div&gt;
   &lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
</code></pre>

<p>Cards know to be pain in the.. But I hope this helps.</p>
